<!DOCTYPE html>
<html> 
<head> 

<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Last Human Message</title>

<style>

*{
    box-sizing:border-box;
}

body{
    margin:0;
    min-height:100vh;
    background:
    radial-gradient(circle at top,#b00020 0%,#300000 45%,#090909 100%);
    color:white;
    font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
}


.container{
    width:90%;
    max-width:850px;
    margin:auto;
    padding:70px 20px;
    text-align:center;
}


.logo{
    font-size:18px;
    letter-spacing:5px;
    color:#ffb3b3;
    font-weight:bold;
}


h1{
    font-size:clamp(42px,7vw,75px);
    font-weight:900;
    margin:25px 0;
    line-height:1.1;
}


.subtitle{
    font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,34px);
    font-weight:800;
    line-height:1.4;
}


.description{
    margin:35px auto;
    max-width:650px;
    font-size:clamp(18px,2vw,24px);
    line-height:1.8;
    color:#f5f5f5;
}


.card{

    margin-top:50px;
    padding:45px 30px;

    background:
    rgba(255,255,255,0.08);

    backdrop-filter:blur(15px);

    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);

    border-radius:30px;

    box-shadow:
    0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);

}


.price{
    font-size:38px;
    font-weight:900;
}


button{

    margin-top:30px;

    padding:20px 45px;

    border:none;

    border-radius:50px;

    background:white;

    color:#700000;

    font-size:22px;

    font-weight:900;

    cursor:pointer;

    transition:.3s;

}


button:hover{

    transform:scale(1.05);

}


.footer{

    margin-top:60px;

    color:#ccc;

    font-size:16px;

}



@media(max-width:600px){

.container{
    padding-top:40px;
}


.card{
    padding:30px 20px;
}


button{
    width:100%;
    font-size:20px;
}


}


</style>


</head>


<body>


<div class="container">


<div class="logo">
GLOBAL HUMAN CONNECTION
</div>


<h1>
LAST HUMAN MESSAGE
</h1>


<div class="subtitle">
A stranger left a message for you.
</div>


<div class="description">

You don't know who they are.<br>

You don't know what they wrote.<br><br>

Maybe it's a secret.<br>
Maybe it's a life experience.<br>
Maybe it's a simple sentence that changes your day.

</div>



<div class="card">


<div class="price">
$2.00
</div>


<p>
Unlock the last message.<br>
Then leave your own message<br>
for the next human.
</p>



<button>
🔓 REVEAL THE MESSAGE
</button>


</div>


<div class="footer">

🌎 A chain of thoughts, feelings and stories from humans around the world.

</div>


</div>


</body>
</html>
